OL,3,GNEWSACordon removed at scene of dog
OL,4,Awalker's death
OL,5,
OL,6,FA police cordon has been lifted from an
OL,7,Farea of woodland at the centre of an
OL,8,Fongoing murder investigation.
OL,10,FGraham Pennycook, 64, was found dead in
OL,11,Fthe woods next to Perham Down polo
OL,12,Ffield in Ludgershall, Wiltshire on 24
OL,13,FSeptember.
OL,15,FWiltshire Police said the investigation
OL,16,Finto his death was continuing "at
OL,17,Fpace", and the force has released more
OL,18,Finformation about potential witnesses
OL,19,Fit wants to trace.
OL,23,APub: 12-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
