OL,3,GNEWSACordon removed at scene of dog
OL,4,Awalker's death
OL,5,
OL,6,FOfficers want to hear from anyone who
OL,7,Fmay have CCTV or dashcam footage of the
OL,8,Farea, or who may know someone who
OL,9,Fdisposed of their clothing at the time,
OL,10,For had new and unexplained injuries.
